  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Release Notes\n## 2.1.2\n- Added `Type` to flight details in quote and sale requests\n## 2.1.1\n- Added package version to the request header to enable tracking\n## 2.1.0\n- Added optional `MemberClient` support to quote\n- Added support for updating sale items\n## 2.0.1\n- Added optional `returnHtml` support to `GetQuoteAsync`; defaults to `false`\n## 2.0.0\n- Upgraded target framework from .NET 8 to .NET 10\n- Updated all Microsoft.Extensions.* dependencies to latest 10.0.x versions\n## 1.1.0\n- Added `IPulseApiClientFactory` for creating API clients with dynamic partner credentials at runtime\n- Added `AddPulseApiClientFactory()` extension method for DI registration\n- Enables internal systems to make API requests on behalf of multiple partners without restarting or reconfiguring\n## 1.0.5\n- Updated date-related fields across request models from string to DateTimeOffset\n## 1.0.4\n- Added values array for quote request\n## 1.0.3\n- Added release notes support\n## 1.0.1\n- Bug Fixes\n## 1.0.0\n- Initial release",
